Each row names its evaluation handle, content digest, original submission index and
execution comparison key. `latest_verified` and `best_partial` are distinct:
`best_partial` identifies the best observed value in its declared direction within a
matching comparison key, not a complete passing metric or adoption authority. Compare progress and values
only within matching quantity, unit, direction and execution context. Unknown context
cannot establish comparability. Active or cancelled producers do not revoke a retained
snapshot's content or accuracy proof.
