the explicitly offered base option {{ root_revision }}; its verification status is
shown above independently of parent recommendations. An invalid selection
requires correction and never silently starts from base. Inspect pinned source changes
and artifact references for the mechanisms the task requires; a rate or title alone
cannot prove that a prerequisite exists. Each sibling has its own workspace and session.
